==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|leggje}}
* {{nn-inf|legg}}

===Etymology===
{{root|nn|ine-pro|*legʰ-}}
From {{inh|nn|non|leggja||lay, put, place}}, from {{inh|nn|gem-pro|*lagjaną}}. Akin to {{cog|en|lay}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|no|/²lɛjːɑ/|/²lɛɟ͡ʝːɑ/|/²lɛʝːɑ/}}

===Verb===
{{nn-verb-comireg}}

# [[lay]]; [[put]] something in a [[horizontal]] position
#: {{usex|nn|Eg '''legg''' det her.|I'll '''put''' it here.}}
# to [[build]], [[make]].
# to [[spread out]].

'''leggja att'''
# to {{l|en|leave}}, leave behind
#: ''Eg '''legg att''' nokon bøker som eg ikkje treng meir.''
#:: I will '''leave''' (behind) some books that I don't need anymore.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|nn|leggja seg}}

===References===
* {{R:Dokpro|lang=nn}}

